Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.51,0:23:33.60,EDEN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}Where did you go
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.73,0:22:20.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}当我尝到你的酸涩与甘甜
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.36,0:22:23.82,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你却选择拉长每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.82,0:22:28.37,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你怎能如此漠然
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.41,0:22:33.20,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}何时色彩离开了你的双眼
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.66,0:22:38.38,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}何时瞳中的新绿开始消散
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}只剩下一片幽蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.26,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}幽深的蓝
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.84,0:22:47.34,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}落叶织就的床沿
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.97,0:22:54.18,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你为何偏偏要离开我身边？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.73,0:22:59.90,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}沙粒一点一点
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.44,0:23:03.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}溜出我的指间
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.65,0:23:06.61,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}我努力去分辨
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.82,0:23:10.41,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像未解的谜团
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.41,0:23:11.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像我坠入的海渊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.95,0:23:13.49,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像旧靴的鞋面
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.49,0:23:15.04,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像命运牵起的线
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.04,0:23:16.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}带我来到你身边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.62,0:23:18.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}幽蓝 像浆果汁一般
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.21,0:23:19.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(200,200)}是我心底的怅然
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:24.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}如今你究竟去了哪边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.97,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}明明曾与你心意相连
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.51,0:23:33.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.4\fad(350,350)}你究竟去了哪边
